description: Recall and record durable project memory via the memory-inject MCP server
alwaysApply: true
---

# Memory

- At the start of a session, read the `memory://` resource from the
  `memory-inject` MCP server that matches your working directory
  (plus `memory://global`) before starting work.
- Record durable, verified learnings (pitfalls, decisions, project
  specifics) with the `memory_note` tool, passing `directory` = the
  absolute path of the repo you are working in. One tight bullet per
  note; global, cross-project rules use `global: true`.
